  m_text: "Welcome to the XR Interaction Toolkit examples, here you\u2019ll find
    examples of an XR rig setup with ray and grab interactors, locomotion settings
    and a variety of interactive objects.\n\nYou can use this walkthrough to teleport
    through the interactive stations, or your right thumbstick to teleport and your
    left thumbstick to move freely between areas.\n\nInteract with 2D UI with the
    trigger button, and 3D controls with the grip."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f675742eaf9c20a4f909d78ee7a14fed, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 4687939059374929122, guid: f675742eaf9c20a4f909d78ee7a14fed, type: 2}
